<spell-notebook "radio theming">
	<header level="1">
		Radio
		<header>A radio button lets a user choose exactly one value of a group.</>
	</>
	<radio-tab-bar showing="theming"/>
	<section>
		<html>
			<ui-menu class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
				<ui-item link="#tokens">Tokens</>
				<ui-item link="#themes">Themes</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the checkbox family's tokens a radio reads, live. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			A radio reads the checkbox family's `--ui-checkbox-*` tokens: the shared box, label and focus tokens, plus its
			own `--ui-checkbox-radio-size`, `--ui-checkbox-radio-top` and `--ui-checkbox-bullet-scale` (the dot's size in
			the circle). Set one on the element, on any ancestor (a form, `:root`), or on the root box through
			`::part(checkbox)`. Slider and toggle radios read the slider and toggle tokens: the
			[checkbox page](/components/ui/ui-checkbox.html) lists them all.
		</>
		<markdown>
			```css
			ui-radio {
			  --ui-checkbox-bullet-scale: 0.6;
			  --ui-checkbox-mark-color: var(--ui-primary);
			}
			```
		</>
		<markdown>Edit a value below to try it.</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-checkbox" tokens="--ui-checkbox-radio* --ui-checkbox-bullet* --ui-checkbox-mark-color --ui-checkbox-size --ui-checkbox-label* --ui-checkbox-border* --ui-checkbox-background* --ui-checkbox-focus*" playground>
				<ui-radio name="theming-preview" value="a" selected>Chosen</>
				<ui-radio name="theming-preview" value="b">Not chosen</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling radios (the checkbox family's) through its tokens.
		</>
	</>
</spell-notebook>
